{"unit_id":"wangyuanchuan2022__dsh-agents#card-zh","repo":"wangyuanchuan2022/dsh-agents","commit":"e7fe3bef48c7cc21e72746c6e79ec5bbcfc7ce31","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agents 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的多角色协作插件，提供角色目录、任务书合成和子会话派发工具。它把任务交给专职角色，按角色解析 LOW、MEDIUM、HIGH 模型档位，并将人格与交付要求注入新建会话。主要能力包括按泳道和档位查询角色、检查或调整模型路由、预览任务书、创建角色会话及按 minimal 模式派发。适合希望把规划、实现、调试、评审等工作拆给不同子代理的 DSH 用户。模型选择依赖 DSH 已配置的 provider；插件本身不声明额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:8","lib/index.js:1033","lib/index.js:1148","lib/routing.js:105","lib/spawn.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"wangyuanchuan2022__dsh-agents#card-en","repo":"wangyuanchuan2022/dsh-agents","commit":"e7fe3bef48c7cc21e72746c6e79ec5bbcfc7ce31","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agents helps DSH users delegate coding, planning, and review to specialist agents. Its tools list roles, compose task briefs, inspect or change LOW, MEDIUM, and HIGH model routes, and create guided sessions. Briefs can be previewed without dispatch. Models use providers configured in DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:8","lib/index.js:1033","lib/index.js:1148","lib/routing.js:105","lib/spawn.js:1"]}
